From 171af329d23ef845fbd02e865669c9db8c310500 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shikha Panwar <shikhapanwar@google.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Mar 2022 08:54:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Virtualization service to listen for tombstones at VSock port
 from VMs

tombstone_transmit binary running inside the VMs are the Vsock
clients. virtualization_service receives (guest)tomstones from them, requests
for (host)tombstone file to write on -> writes on the file & then
notify tombstoned of the completion (via tombstoned_client)

Test:m succeeds, tested the whole topic by manually crashing random
proceses inside VM (ran them via microdroid demo)

Bug: 202153827
Change-Id: Ifcaa5da968ef39fdd05612d3e0baca4fd1c5eaf1
